</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>More importantly, the team stopped being "fooled" by CTR numbers and focused on crafting "converting creatives"—those that clearly communicate product value, reach genuine needs, and align with landing pages.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>
<p>Creative review isn't about finding the "best creative," but identifying the "most suitable creative for current campaign objectives." High performance doesn't guarantee high conversion, and high conversion doesn't require explosive CTR.</p>
<p>Finding the balance between the two is the true goal of Meta ad creative optimization.</p>
<p>If you're struggling with creative review, feel free to consult with Yiyumedia's advertising advisors. We can help you analyze account data and identify which creatives are truly holding back your ROI.</p>
